:volu world BOX 500*cm 500*cm 500*cm G4_Galactic
:vis world OFF
:volu room BOX 50*cm 50*cm 50*cm G4_Galactic
:vis room OFF
:rotm r000 0 0 0
:rotm r90x 90 0 180 0 90 90
:rotm r15 90  15 180 0 90 105 
:rotm r90y 180 0 90 90 90 0
:rotm r225 90 135 0 0 90 225
:rotm r315 90 45 180 135 90 315 

:solid GeMain TUBE 0 12.45*mm 4.10*mm

:solid BottomHole TUBE 0 6.15*mm 1.11*mm
:solid GeMinusBottom SUBTRACTION GeMain BottomHole r000 0 0 -3.01*mm

:solid TopGroove TUBE 3.45*mm 7.45*mm 0.76*mm
:solid AK01_Ge SUBTRACTION GeMinusBottom TopGroove r000 0 0 3.36*mm

:volu GeCrystal(S) AK01_Ge G4_Ge
:color GeCrystal(S) .5 .5 .7 1

:place room 1 world r000 0 0 0
:place GeCrystal(S) 400 room r90x 0 -15*cm 0 
